  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing food safety practices to unlock market access for Gambian cashew</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will pursue the following outcome, outputs, as expected results, thus responding to the main challenges identified in the sector aligned to the project objective:  Outcome: Strengthened national food safety system - Output 1.  Updated food safety legal framework through public-private consultations - Output 2. Capacities of cashew producers, processors, and cooperatives strengthened to comply with food safety requirements - Output 3: Strengthened capacities of national institutions to comply with international food safety standards .</narrative>
  </description>
